      "kind": "call",
      "text": "第八步：GPU 合成真正的执行点——dequeue client target、RenderEngine::drawLayers、queueBuffer。"
    },
    {
      "at": 54,
      "quote": "ftl::Future<std::monostate> future;",
      "kind": "data",
      "text": "present 的完成信号。"
    },
    {
      "at": 55,
      "quote": "const bool flushEvenWhenDisabled = !refreshArgs.bufferIdsToUncache.empty();",
      "kind": "data",
      "text": "即使输出被关，也要把待回收 buffer 的命令刷下去。"
    },
    {
      "at": 56,
      "quote": "if (mOffloadPresent) {",
      "kind": "branch",
      "text": "本帧把 present 卸到 HWC 异步 worker。"
    },
    {
      "at": 57,
      "quote": "future = presentFrameAndReleaseLayersAsync(flushEvenWhenDisabled);",
      "kind": "call",
      "text": "异步 present：主线程不等 HAL 返回，多屏时能显著缩短整帧。"
    },
    {
      "at": 58,
      "quote": "",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "空行。"
    },
    {
      "at": 59,
      "quote": "// Only offload for this frame. The next frame will determine whether it",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "注释说明这是「一次性」的卸载。"
    },
    {
      "at": 60,
      "quote": "// needs to be offloaded. Leave the HwcAsyncWorker in place. For one thing,",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "worker 不销毁，避免反复创建。",
      "text2": ""
    },
    {
      "at": 61,
      "quote": "// it is currently presenting. Further, it may be needed next frame, and",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "它此刻正在 present，销毁会造成竞态。"
    },
    {
      "at": 62,
      "quote": "// we don't want to churn.",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "注释收尾。"
    },
    {
      "at": 63,
      "quote": "mOffloadPresent = false;",
      "kind": "state",
      "text": "只对本帧生效，下一帧重新判定。"
    },
    {
      "at": 64,
      "quote": "} else {",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "默认路径：同步 present。"
